<article data-astro-cid-ruppqpzn>
<h2 data-astro-cid-ruppqpzn>What is VibeRater Social?</h2>
<p data-astro-cid-ruppqpzn>VibeRater Social is the next social version of VibeRater: rate a photo, turn it into a Vibie, share it with a Squad, and discover people or places by vibe rather than follower count.</p>
</article><article data-astro-cid-ruppqpzn>
<h2 data-astro-cid-ruppqpzn>Can I download VibeRater Social today?</h2>
<p data-astro-cid-ruppqpzn>You can download VibeRater: Aura today on the App Store. VibeRater Social is the next version, built around Vibies, Squad reactions, Radar, MiniVibe, and cleaner feeds.</p>
</article><article data-astro-cid-ruppqpzn>
<h2 data-astro-cid-ruppqpzn>What are Vibies?</h2>
<p data-astro-cid-ruppqpzn>Vibies are story-style posts made from rated photos, captions, receipts, share cards, or anthem-style moments.</p>
</article><article data-astro-cid-ruppqpzn>
<h2 data-astro-cid-ruppqpzn>What is SlopGuard?</h2>
<p data-astro-cid-ruppqpzn>SlopGuard is a cleaner-feed helper for suspected AI-generated image posts. It is a filter aid, not a promise that every AI image will be detected perfectly.</p>
</article><article data-astro-cid-ruppqpzn>
<h2 data-astro-cid-ruppqpzn>Does VibeRater sell my personal data?</h2>
<p data-astro-cid-ruppqpzn>No. Dudley does not sell your personal data. For the app available today, the VibeRater privacy policy explains how photos and app data are handled.</p>
</article>
</section>
